 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nRheinland Logistik GmbH                         MASTER SERVICES\nHauptstraße 42, 20095 Hamburg, Germany                  AGREEMENT\nUSt-IdNr: DE956904462\nReg No: DE-731044\n\nVON                                                     RECHNUNGSADRESSE\n\nRheinland Logistik GmbH                                Rheinland Logistik GmbH\nHauptstraße 42                                         Hauptstraße 42\n20095 Hamburg                                          80331 München\nGermany                                                Germany\nVAT: DE956904462\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 28.01.2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Rheinland Logistik GmbH, with its registered office at Hauptstraße 42, Hamburg\n(\"Party A\"), and Rheinland Logistik GmbH, with its registered office at Hauptstraße 42, München\n(\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Rheinland Logistik GmbH / Anna Weber\n Party B   Rheinland Logistik GmbH / Hans Schneider\n Date      28.01.2026",
